sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Scenario as AI Recon Scenario
    participant Factory as create_ai_agent()
    participant Agent as AiAgent
    participant LC as create_agent<br/>(LangGraph ReAct)
    participant Model as ChatModel<br/>(PROVIDER_MAP)
    participant Tools as LangChain Tools
    participant Target as Target Network

    User->>Scenario: nsak scenario run ai-reconnaissance
    activate Scenario

    Scenario->>Factory: create_ai_agent(response_format=Result,<br/>load_drill_tools, load_mcp_tools)
    activate Factory
    Note right of Factory: reads config.ai, assembles tools<br/>cli_tool, host_configuration, send_email<br/>(+ drills, MCP, human_interaction_hook)

    Factory->>Agent: AiAgent(provider, model, tools, response_format)
    activate Agent
    Agent->>Model: create_model() via PROVIDER_MAP<br/>(+ UsageCallback)
    Agent->>LC: create_agent(model, tools, middleware,<br/>system_prompt, response_format)
    Note right of Agent: middleware TrackToolCallMiddleware<br/>response_format wrapped in ToolStrategy (gpt-oss)
    Agent-->>Factory: agent
    deactivate Agent
    Factory-->>Scenario: AiAgent
    deactivate Factory

    Scenario->>LC: ainvoke({messages: [prompt]})
    activate LC
    loop ReAct loop (until done)
        LC->>Model: reason / plan next step
        Model-->>LC: tool call
        LC->>Tools: cli_tool("nmap ...") / drill
        activate Tools
        Tools->>Target: execute scan / drill
        Target-->>Tools: raw output
        Tools-->>LC: result (tracked by middleware)
        deactivate Tools
        Note over LC,Model: UsageCallback.on_llm_end<br/>tracks token usage
    end

    LC->>Model: format final answer
    Model-->>LC: structured output<br/>(response_format schema)
    LC-->>Scenario: {messages, structured_response}
    deactivate LC

    Scenario-->>User: ReconnaissanceScenarioResult + report
    deactivate Scenario
